            "Info": "Indicates the delay in responding to non-critical recursion changes.\n-"
        }
    ],
    "Examples": [
        [
            "<HUAWEI> system-view",
            "[~HUAWEI] bgp 100",
            "[*HUAWEI-bgp] ipv4-family unicast",
