To set a hard limit of 500 dynamic BGP sessions for a specific group on your Nokia 7750 SR, use the following CLI configuration:

```cli
configure router bgp
    group "DYNAMIC_GROUP"
        dynamic-neighbor
            prefix <ip-prefix/prefix-length>
        exit
