To enable VPN route exchange between different autonomous systems on your Nokia 7750 SR, apply the following configuration:

```cli
configure router bgp
    enable-inter-as-vpn
    group "PARTNER_GROUP"
        peer-as <PARTNER_AS_NUMBER>
        neighbor <PARTNER_IP_ADDRESS>
        family vpn-ipv4   # Enable VPNv4 address family
