To prevent the router from sending network path details back to peers in the same cluster and avoid routing loops, configure the `cluster` command under the BGP group context. This ensures consistent cluster IDs across route reflectors, enabling loop prevention mechanisms like CLUSTER_LIST.

```cli
configure router bgp
