2. **`resolution-filter` lines**: Specify allowed tunnel types (e.g., `ldp`, `rsvp`, `sr-te`, `mpls`). Replace these examples with your preferred tunnel types in priority order (TTM selects the highest-priority available tunnel).

For **VPN routes** (e.g., VPNv4/VPNv6), repeat the configuration under `family vpn`:
```cli
family vpn
    resolution filter
    resolution-filter ldp
    resolution-filter rsvp
