   ```cli
   /configure router policy-options
        policy-statement "ADVERTISE_CATCH_ALL"
            entry 10
                from prefix-list "CATCH_ALL"
                action accept
            exit
            entry 20
                action next-policy
            exit
        exit
   ```

3. **Apply the policy to designated BGP neighbors under their respective groups:**
   ```cli
   /configure router bgp
        group <group-name>
            neighbor <neighbor-ip>
