5. **`local-as 65001 no-prepend-global-as`**:
   - Uses a dummy private ASN (65001) for the session instead of your real ASN (65535).
   - `no-prepend-global-as` prevents your backbone ASN (65535) from being prepended to the AS_PATH in advertised routes.
